Real Estate Market Trends and Investment Analytics | CodeAlpha

📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analysing real estate market data using Microsoft Power BI. The dashboard provides insights into property prices, rental trends, market demand, supply, and investment opportunities.

The main objective is to transform real estate data into meaningful visual insights that support better property investment and market-related decisions.

🎯 Project Objectives

- Analyse property price trends.
- Understand rental market patterns and rental yields.
- Evaluate real estate market demand and supply.
- Identify potential investment opportunities.
- Explore geographical differences in property markets.
- Present interactive visualisations for data-driven decision-making.

🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Microsoft Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX (Data Analysis Expressions)
- Data Cleaning and Transformation
- Data Modelling
- Data Visualization

📊 Dashboard Overview

1. Real Estate Market Overview

Provides an overall picture of the real estate market through key performance indicators and visualisations.

2. Property Price Analysis

Explores property prices and their variations across different locations and property categories.

3. Market Trends & Investment Analytics

Focuses on market patterns and investment-related insights to help understand potential opportunities.

💡 Key Analytical Areas

- Property price distribution
- Property price comparisons
- Rental market analysis
- Rental yield analysis
- Market demand and supply
- Location-wise market performance
- Investment trend analysis

📁 Project Files

- "CodeAlpha_Real_Estate_Dashboard.pbix" – Interactive Power BI dashboard.
- Dataset file – Data used for the analysis.
- Dashboard screenshots – Visual previews of the dashboard (if included).

📈 Expected Business Value

This dashboard can help users:

- Understand real estate market trends.
- Compare property prices across locations.
- Explore rental and investment opportunities.
- Identify areas with promising market activity.
- Make more informed real estate decisions.

